@crackedopal/dsh-clinepass README · dsh-clinepass：[English](README.en.md)

为 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) 提供 **ClinePass 订阅的模型接入、用量查看与多账号管理**，让额度、重置时间和账号切换更方便。

本插件派生自 [dsh-opencode-go](https://github.com/Duskriver/dsh-opencode-go)，按 ClinePass 的接口重写了模型目录、用量读取与请求身份，其余设置界面与账号机制沿用同一套实现。

@crackedopal/dsh-clinepass README · 分组高级设置：高级设置按 **用量**、**连接**、**缓存与超时**、**图片处理** 分组。悬停问号查看说明，可通过 **全部恢复默认** 清除该卡片的自定义覆盖，再保存修改；当前账号选择保持不变。

支持 HTTP、HTTPS 和 SOCKS5 代理，保存后用于后续对话与用量查询。代理运行在 DSH 所在的机器上；远程部署中的 `127.0.0.1` 指服务器自身。

ClinePass 只提供 OpenAI 兼容的 Chat Completions 协议，因此本插件不提供协议切换选项。

@crackedopal/dsh-clinepass README · dsh-clinepass：[中文](README.md)

**ClinePass subscription models, usage, and multi-account management** for
[DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness).

This plugin is derived from [dsh-opencode-go](https://github.com/Duskriver/dsh-opencode-go).
The model catalog, the usage reads, and the request identity were rewritten for ClinePass;
the settings surface and the account machinery reuse the same implementation.

@crackedopal/dsh-clinepass README · Models：`cline-pass/*` rows are subscription models and `cline-free/*` rows are Cline's free tier;
they share one API key and one base URL, so both are offered. Free rows carry " (free)" in
their label so they cannot be confused with the paid row that shares their name.

Prices are measured billing rates ($/1M tokens) used for settings-page and analytics
estimates. They **do not** drive the ClinePass quota: the official percentages do.

@crackedopal/dsh-clinepass README · Pick a model and adjust parameters：Streaming, thinking, tool calls, and image input depend on the model. Only models whose catalog
entry declares the image modality accept image attachments; every other model refuses image
content before any provider I/O.
